			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"Planning to build a large ship? Be careful—if your vessel is too heavy, it might sink partially below the waves!"
				"That’s where the Floater block comes in. This special block increases your ship's buoyancy."
				"Place several Floaters along the bottom of your ship to help it stay level and ride higher on the water. The bigger your ship, the more Floaters you'll need."
				"A true shipwright knows: a balanced hull is a fast hull!"
			]
